<p>Provisional answer keys and recorded responses for those 84 subjects were hosted, The Times of India said, from 16 to 18 August 2026. Challenges from that window were part of result processing. They are closed. A fresh “challenge link” shared in September for a subject that was already declared in August is not a second chance unless NTA has opened one on its own site.</p>
