<p>The release says eligibility, self-declaration and documents of eligible candidates shall be verified by the concerned authorities under the June 2026 information bulletin. The scorecard does not replace that verification. It also says the result is on https://ugcnet.nta.nic.in/ and that candidates can log in to view, download and print the scorecard. A public notice the same day said the final answer keys for English, Commerce and Sociology were on that site.</p>
