<p>Some candidate guides summarise Assistant Professor eligibility as lifetime and JRF as valid for a shorter period, often described as three years. That summary is common. It is not reprinted as a rule on this page, because the June 2026 information bulletin is the document that sets validity, age and relaxation. Read the bulletin before you tell a department your fellowship window. If the bulletin and a coaching thumbnail disagree, the bulletin wins.</p>
