<p>If UEFA moves the kick-off, the sentence and the SportsEvent start time have to move together. The start time filed with this page is 2026-10-03T20:45:00+02:00, which is the 18:45 UTC instant. A later bulletin that truly means 19:45 in Oviedo would be an hour earlier and would be 23:15 IST on Saturday. Until that bulletin exists, 20:45 CEST is the working clock.</p>
